<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JAS" style="id">-Tonga Translation Project</book>
  <para style="h">Jakkobbu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lugwalo Lwakazwa kuli Jakkobbu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jakkobbu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Jakk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Lugwalo Lwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">JAKKOBBU</para>
  <para style="imt">Manjililo</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Lugwalo lwaJakkobbu</char> lyakalembwa awumwi utegwa Jakkobbu. Ooyu wakalemba lugwalo oolu kuyeyelwa kuti wakali mwanike waJesu, wakali muzulidi mumbungano ntaanzi mpawo wakali umwi wabakali mugobelo lyamuJerusalemu (Inchito 15:13). Mutumwa Pawulu wakali kumwiita kuti musemu wambungano (BaGalatiya 2:9). Basikufunkununa basyoma kuti ibbuku lyaJakkobbu lyakalembwa aminyaka ilimakumi musanu Kkirisitu kaali wazyalwa. Mbuukunga Jakkobbu wakali muzulidi wambungano yamuJerusalemu, ukonzya kuti wakalilemba naakali kukkala nkuko.</para>
  <para style="ip">Jakkobbu wakalemba bbuku lyakwe “Kumikowa ilikkumi ayibili yakali sanseene mumanyika” (Jakkobbu 1:1). Injiisyo Jakkobu ilabeleka kubanaKkirisitu boonse pesi mabelekelo amajwi aaya, “Mikowa ilikkumi ayibili” ipa kuti zibe antanganana kuti Jakkobbu wakali kulemba kalangene abanaKkirisitu bachiJuda. Nkaambo lugwalo oolu lwakaleelede kuti lukasike kunkamu yabaabo babala, lijata mitwe yamakani miingi. Jakkobbu ulangide bulidilano akati kalusyomo amilimu. Lusyomo lwachoonzyo luyoozibikana amilimu (Jakkobbu 2:17). Alimwi ulachenjezya atala akusaluuzyana kubavubi (Jakkobbu 2:1-4). Alimwi ulatwaambila kuti tuchenjele atala anzitwamba (Jakkobbu 3:1-12).</para>
  <para style="iot">Bwiime</para>
  <para style="io1">Jakkobbu ujuzya babali balugwalo lwakwe (Jakkobbu 1:1)</para>
  <para style="io1">Chitobela, usungwazya banaKkirisitu kuti bakakatile mukupenzegwa (Jakkobbu 1:2-27)</para>
  <para style="io1">Eelyo waamba kuti ziyandika biyeni kuti lusyomo luliboniye mukwiinda mumulimu (Jakkobbu 2:1-26)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kwayinda eezi waamba kuti alaanguzu biyeni majwi (Jakkobbu 3:1-12)</para>
  <para style="io1">Eelyo Jakkobbu upandulula busongo bwaLeza mbubusiyene abusongo bwamunyika (Jakkobbu 3:13—4:10)</para>
  <para style="io1">Chitobela, uchenjezya babali balugwalo lwakwe atala akulisumpula (Jakkobbu 4:11—5:6)</para>
  <para style="io1">Jakkobbu umaninizya lugwalo lyakwe akupa malayilile asiyenesiyene (Jakkobbu 5:7-20)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JAS 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 1:1" />Ndime Jakkobbu, mulanda waLeza awaMwami Jesu Kkirisitu,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JAS 1:1">Kumikowa ilikkumi ayibili imwayikide munyika yoonse:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JAS 1:1">Ndamujuzya.<verse eid="JAS 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lusyomo aBusongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 1:2" />Nibakwesu, akube lukondo loonse, kuti mwaswaanana amasunko asiyenesiyene, <verse eid="JAS 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 1:3" />nkaambo mulizi kuti kusunkwa kwalusyomo lwanu kuzyala lukakatilo. <verse eid="JAS 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 1:4" />Alimwi amuleke lukakatilo lubeleke chakumaninina, kuti mukakomene akuzulila, kakutakwe nchimubula. <verse eid="JAS 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 1:5" />Kuti umwi wanu wabula busongo, ngakumbile kuli Leza, ooyo upa kubantu boonse abuuya mpawo kakutakwe kaambo pe, alimwi uyoobupegwa. <verse eid="JAS 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 1:6" />Pesi ngakumbile mulusyomo, kakutakwe kudoneeka pe, nkaambo ooyo udoneeka ulimbuli yuwe lyamulwizi litontwa akuungwa aluwo. <verse eid="JAS 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 1:7" />Ooyo muntu tayelede kulangilila kutambula chintu pe kuzwa kuMwami. <verse eid="JAS 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 1:8" />Muntu uliboobo ujisi myoyo iibili alimwi takkalinkene pe muzintu zyoonse nzyachita.<verse eid="JAS 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Buchete Abuvubi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 1:9" />Amuleke mukwesu ulifwiinsya alikankayizye muchiindi naasumpulwa, <verse eid="JAS 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 1:10" />alimwi muvubi alikankayizye naafwiinsigwa, nkaambo mbuli dubaluba lyamusokwe ulafwa. <verse eid="JAS 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 1:11" />Nkaambo izuba lilapasuka akuumpa kwalyo alimwi lilapusamya bwizu; idubaluba lyalyo lilaloka, mpawo bubotu bwalyo bulafwa. Aboobo munzila njiyeeyi alakwe muvubi uyoonyonyooka akati kamilimu yakwe.<verse eid="JAS 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kweezegwa Akusunkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 1:12" />Ulaachoolwe muntu ukakatila mumisunko, nkaambo natazunde musunko, uyootambula musini wabuumi ooyo Leza ngwakasyomezya kulibaabo bamuyanda. <verse eid="JAS 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 1:13" />Kutabi muntu waamba kuti naawasunkwa, “Ndasunkwa aLeza,” nkaambo Leza takonzyi kusunkwa abubi alimwi we lwakwe tasunki muntu pe; <verse eid="JAS 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 1:14" />pesi muntu awumwi ulasunkwa naawongelezegwa akuchegwa achiyandisyo chakwe chabubi. <verse eid="JAS 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 1:15" />Eelyo chiyandisyo chabubi nichakomena chilazyala chibi; mpawo chibi nichakomena cheeta lufu.<verse eid="JAS 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 1:16" />Nibakwesu nimuyandwa, muteenwi pe. <verse eid="JAS 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 1:17" />Chipo choonse chibotu achiluleme chizwa kujulu, chilaseluka aansi kuzwa kuli Taata wamimuni yamumulengalenga, utasanduki mbuli munzinzimwa usunzuluka. <verse eid="JAS 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 1:18" />Akuyanda kwakwe wakatweeta ajwi lyakasimpe kuti tweelede kuba muchelo mutaanzi wazilengwa zyakwe.<verse eid="JAS 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumvwa Akuchita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 1:19" />Nibakwesu nimuyandwa, ngamuzibe eechi. Amuleke muntu woonse afwambane kumvwa, atafwambani kwaambuula, atafwambani kunyema, <verse eid="JAS 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 1:20" />nkaambo kunyema kwamuntu takubeleki busalali bwaLeza pe. <verse eid="JAS 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 1:21" />Nkikaako ngamusowe busofwazi boonse akugwisya bubi buzwide boonse mpawo akulifwiinsya mutambule ijwi lyakabyalwa mulindinywe, likonzya kufutula myuuya yanu.<verse eid="JAS 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 1:22" />Pesi ngamube basikuchita bajwi, alimwi peepe basikumvwa luzutu, kamulyeena. <verse eid="JAS 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 1:23" />Nkaambo kuti umwi waba sikumvwa wajwi alimwi katali sikuchita, ulimbuli muntu ulilanga kubusyu bwakwe muchiboniboni; <verse eid="JAS 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 1:24" />nkaambo ulalilanga mpawo weenda alimwi mpawaawo ulaliluba kuti ulibiyeni. <verse eid="JAS 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 1:25" />Pesi kuli ooyo ulanga mumulawu ululeme, mulawu walwangunuko akukakatila, katali sikumvwa ooyo uluba pesi sikuchita ooyo uchita, uyoolongezegwa mukuchita kwakwe.<verse eid="JAS 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 1:26" />Kuti kakuli uyeeya kuti mukombi, mpawo katakonzyi kuzyotolola lulimi lwakwe pesi weena moyo wakwe, bukombi bwamuntu ooyo mbwabiyo. <verse eid="JAS 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JAS 1:27" />Bukombi oobo bululeme alimwi butasofwede pe kunembo lyaLeza aTaata mboobu: kuswaya bamuchaala abamukabafu mumapenzi aabo, akulibamba kakutakwe kabata kuzwa kunyika.<verse eid="JAS 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JAS 2" />
  <para style="s">Machenjezyo Atala Akusalula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 2:1" />Nibakwesu, mutatondeezyi lusalulo mbuli mbumujisi lusyomo lwaMwami wesu Jesu Kkirisitu, Mwami wabulemu. <verse eid="JAS 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 2:2" />Nkaambo kuti muntu uli anweenwe zyangolide azisamo zyeebeka waza mumbungano yako, amuntu muchete ulaazisamo zidelukide alakwe wanjila, <verse eid="JAS 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 2:3" />alimwi waswiilizya ooyo usamide zisamo zyeebeka mpawo wati, “Kkala achuuno eechi chibotu,” kakuli wati kumuntu muchete, “Imikila aawo,” nikuba, “Kkala aansi kumawulu aangu,” <verse eid="JAS 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 2:4" />teemwasaluuzyana na akati kanu, akuba babetesi amiyeeyo yabubi?<verse eid="JAS 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 2:5" />Nibakwesu nimuyandwa, Amuswiilile. Leza taakabasala na aabo bachete munyika kuti babe bavubi mulusyomo akukona bwami oobo mbwakasyomezya kulibaabo bamuyanda? <verse eid="JAS 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 2:6" />Pesi inywe mwasampawula muntu muchete. Teesi bavubi na bamudyamizya, teembabo na bamutola munkuta? <verse eid="JAS 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 2:7" />Teembabo na basampawula izina lilemekwa lyayooyo nkumubede?<verse eid="JAS 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 2:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:8. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lev 19:18</ref>.</char>
    </note> Kuti chachoonzyo mwazuzukizya mulawu wabwaami, mbuli mumalembe, “Uyooyanda nguyakilene aawe mbuli lwako,” Wachita kabotu. <verse eid="JAS 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 2:9" />Pesi kuti watondeezya kusalulana, wachita chibi, alimwi watyola mulawu mbuli basikubisya. <verse eid="JAS 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 2:10" />Nkaambo kufumbwa ubamba milawu yoonse pesi wakachilwa muli umwi waba amulandu kuli yoonse. <verse eid="JAS 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 2:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:13-14">Kul 20:13-14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:17-18">Det 5:17-18</ref>.</char></note> Nkaambo ooyo wakaamba kuti, “Utachiti bwaamu,” wakaamba alubo kuti, “Utajeyi.” Kuti teewachita bwaamu pesi wajeya, waba sikutyola mulawu. <verse eid="JAS 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 2:12" />Aboobo mwambuule alimwi aboobo muchite mbuli baabo bayobetekwa aansi amulawu walwangunuko. <verse eid="JAS 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 2:13" />Nkaambo lubeta talukwe luse kuli ooyo utatondezezye luse, kakuli luse nduyendelezya atala alubeta.<verse eid="JAS 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lusyomo Amilimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 2:14" />Nibakwesu, nimpindunzi njajana, kuti muntu waamba kuti ulijisi lusyomo pesi katakwe milimu? Lusyomo lwakwe ngalulamufutula na? <verse eid="JAS 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 2:15" />Kuti mukwesu nikuba muchizi wabula chisamo achakulya chabuzuba abuzuba, <verse eid="JAS 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 2:16" />mpawo umwi akati kanu waamba kuti kulimbabo, “Mweende muluumuno, mukasaalilwe akukkuta,” kamutabapede pe zintu ziyanda mibili yabo, zipa mpinduunzi? <verse eid="JAS 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 2:17" />Aboobo lusyomo aluliikke, kuti kalutajisi milimu, lulifwide.<verse eid="JAS 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 2:18" />Pesi umwi uyooti, “Ujisi lusyomo alimwi ime ndijisi milimu.” Nditondeezye lusyomo lwako lutajisi milimu pe, mpawo me amilimu yangu ndilakutondezya lusyomo lwangu. <verse eid="JAS 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 2:19" />Usyoma kuti Leza ngumwi. Wachita kabotu. Nikuba basikazwa balasyoma alimwi balakankama. <verse eid="JAS 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 2:20" />Iwe numufubafuba, ulayanda na kutondeezegwa, kuti lusyomo lutajisi milimu talukwe lugwasyo pe? <verse eid="JAS 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 2:21" />Abburahamu taata wesu teewakalulamikwa amilimu na, naakapeda mwana wakwe Ayizekki achipayililo? <verse eid="JAS 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 2:22" />Wabona kuti lusyomo lwakali kweenda aamwi amilimu yakwe, alimwi lusyomo lwakazuzukizigwa amilimu, <verse eid="JAS 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 2:23" />alimwi malembe akazuzukizigwa aamba kuti, “Abburahamu wakasyoma Leza, alimwi wakayitwa mbuli ululeme,” mpawo wakategwa mweenzunyina waLeza. <verse eid="JAS 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 2:24" />Mwazibona kuti muntu ululamikwa amilimu peepe alusyomo aluliikke.<verse eid="JAS 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 2:25" />Alimwi munzila njiyeeyo alakwe Rahabbu sibwaamu teewakalulamikwa amilimu na aawo naakatambula batumwa akubasunsika kunzila imbi?<verse eid="JAS 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 2:26" />Nkaambo mbuli mubili utajisi muuya ulifwide, aboobo lusyomo lutajisi milimu lulifwide.<verse eid="JAS 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JAS 3" />
  <para style="s">Lulimi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 3:1" />Nibakwesu, kutabi bayingi banu baba bayiisyi, , nkaambo mulizi kuti iswe nituyiisya tuyobetekwa zyindilide kapati. <verse eid="JAS 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 3:2" />Nkaambo toonse tuli akulubizya kwiingi, alimwi kuti umwi katalubizyi muli nzyaamba muntu ululeme, ulakonzya kwendelezya mubili wakwe woonse lubo. <verse eid="JAS 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 3:3" />Kuti twabikka tuzangala kumilomo yambongolo kuti zitulemeke, tulazyotolola mibili yazyo yoonse. <verse eid="JAS 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 3:4" />Tulange alubo kumaato mapati; nikuba kuti mapati loko alimwi alatontwa aluwo lupati, alazyotololwa ansoke ndiini kufumbwa mweenzyi nkwayanda kutozya. <verse eid="JAS 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 3:5" />Aboobo lulimi nchizo chiniini alimwi lulalisumpula azintu zipati.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JAS 3:5">Ndupati biyeni lusaka luumpwa ansasi yamulilo! <verse eid="JAS 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 3:6" />Alimwi lulimi mulilo. Lulimi ninyika italuleme pe akati kazizo zyesu, lubisizya mubili woonse, lukunka mulilo weendelela mubuumi bwakwe boonse, alimwi mbuli mulilo uzwa kubbila lyamulilo. <verse eid="JAS 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 3:7" />Nkaambo musyobo woonse wamunyama awakayuni, waziyavula azilengwa zyamulwizi, zileendelezegwa alimwi zileendelezegwa abantu, <verse eid="JAS 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 3:8" />Pesi taakwe muntu unga uleendelezya lulimi pe ndubi, luzwide buyoka bujeya. <verse eid="JAS 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 3:9" />Andulo tulumbayizya Mwami aTaata, alimwi andulo tutuka bantu, bakalengwa muchikozyano chaLeza. <verse eid="JAS 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 3:10" />Kuzwa kumulomo nguwo ooyo kuzwa kulumbayizya alutuko. Bakwesu, eechi tacheelede kuba mbuboobu pe. <verse eid="JAS 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 3:11" />Kasawu kamwi ngakalakonzya na kugwisya meenda mabotu aalula? <verse eid="JAS 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 3:12" />Nibakwesu, nga mukuyu, ulazyala masansa na, nikuba musamu wamasansa uzyale nkuyu? Taakwe kasawu kalweela kanga kalagwisya meenda mabotu.<verse eid="JAS 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Busongo Buzwa KuJulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 3:13" />Ngwani musongo alimwi umvwisisisya akati kanu? Abuumi bwakwe bubotu ngatondeezye milimu yakwe mukulifwiinsya kwabusongo. <verse eid="JAS 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 3:14" />Pesi kuti kamuli abbivwe abutangazu mumyoyo yanu, mutalisumpuli pe akukaka kasimpe. <verse eid="JAS 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 3:15" />Busongo oobu tabuli mbuli oobo pe buzwa kujulu, pesi kuti mbwamunyika, tabuli bwamuuya, mbubwa Sikuchenga. <verse eid="JAS 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 3:16" />Nkaambo ooko kuli bbivwe abutangazu, kuyooba lupyopyongano alimwi kuchitwa milimu mibi yoonse. <verse eid="JAS 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 3:17" />Pesi busongo buzwa kujulu chitaanzi buliluleme, eelyo buli aluumuno, buli abubombe, bulalemeka, buzwide luse amichelo mibotu, tabukwe kusalulana nikuba kuwupawupa. <verse eid="JAS 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 3:18" />Alimwi butebuzi bwabululami bubyalwa muluumuno abaabo bachita luumuno.<verse eid="JAS 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JAS 4" />
  <para style="s">Kutaba Abweenzunyina Anyika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 4:1" />Niinzi chipa nkondo, alimwi niinzi chipa kulwana akati kanu? Teenjalalando zyanu na eezyo zilimunkondo akati kanu? <verse eid="JAS 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 4:2" />Mulayandisya pesi alimwi taakwe nchimulaacho pe; aboobo mulajeya. Mpawo muli achiyandisyo pesi tamujani pe, aboobo mulalwana mpawo mujana nkondo. Taakwe nchimulaacho pe, nkaambo tamukumbili pe kuli Leza. <verse eid="JAS 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 4:3" />Mulakumbila alimwi tamutambuli pe, nkaambo mukumbila munzila italuleme pe, kuti muzimanine munjalalando zyanu. <verse eid="JAS 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 4:4" />Inywe nibasibwaamu batasyomeki! Tamuzina kuti mwenzunyina anyika nguusinkondonyina aLeza? Nkikaako kufumbwa uyanda kuba mwenzunyina wanyika walichita kuba sinkondonyina aLeza. <verse eid="JAS 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 4:5" />Nikuba kuti muyeeya kuti malembe aamba zyakubeja na kuti, “Uchita buzuba kumuuya ooyo ngwakachita kuti ukkale mulindiswe”? <verse eid="JAS 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 4:6" />Pesi upa luzyalo lwiindilide, nkikaako aamba kuti, “Leza ulabakazya balisumpula, pesi upa luzyalo kuli balibombya.”<verse eid="JAS 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 4:7" />Nkikaako ngamulibombye kuliLeza. Amukazye Sikuchenga mpawo uyoomuchija. <verse eid="JAS 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 4:8" />Ngamuswene afwiifwi kuliLeza alimwi uyooswena afwiifwi kulindinywe. Ngamusambe maboko aanu, inywe nibasizibi, alimwi musalazye myoyo yanu, inywe nibantu basimyoyo ibili. <verse eid="JAS 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 4:9" />Ngamuuse akulila akoomoka. Kuseka kwanu ngakusanduke kube kulila akukondwa kwanu kube kuusa. <verse eid="JAS 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 4:10" />Ngamulibombye lwanu kunembo lyaMwami alimwi uyomusumpula.<verse eid="JAS 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inchenjezyo Atala Akubetekana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 4:11" />Nibakwesu, mutaambuuli bubi atala awumwi. Ooyo waambula bubi atala amweenzunyina nikuba kubeteka mweenzunyina, waambula bubi atala amulawu alimwi ubeteka mulawu. Pesi kuti wabeteka mulawu, tuli sikuchita wamulawu pe pesi sikubeteka. <verse eid="JAS 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 4:12" />Kuli sikupa mulawu uumwi asikubeteka, ooyo ukonzya kufutula akunyonyoona. Pesi nduweni iwe nuubeteka muyakilani wako?<verse eid="JAS 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inchenjezyo Atala Akulisumpula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 4:13" />Amuswiilile lino, inywe nimwaamba kuti, “Sunu nikuba junza tuzoyinka kuteedi nikuba kudolopo liteedi mpawo tukakkale munyaka nkuko alimwi tukasambale akujana mpindu,” <verse eid="JAS 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 4:14" />anukuti taakwe nchuzi atala ajuunza. Niinzi buumi bwanu? Nkaambo mulibasikunku ooyo uba kwachiindi chiniini eelyo mpawo wamana. <verse eid="JAS 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 4:15" />Nikuba boobo mweelede kwaamba kuti, “Kuti Mwami wayanda, tuyoopona mpawo tuyoochita eechi nikuba eechiya.” <verse eid="JAS 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 4:16" />Mbuli mbukubede, mulalikankayizya mubusintaze bwanu. Kulikankayizya ooku koonse nkwabubi.<verse eid="JAS 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 4:17" />Kufumbwa uzi chiluleme kuchita mpawo wakachilwa kuchichita, kulinguwe nchibi.<verse eid="JAS 4:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JAS 5" />
  <para style="s">Machenjezyo Kubavubi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 5:1" />Lino amuswiilile, inywe nibavubi, ngamulile akoomoka nkaambo kamapenzi ayoomusikila. <verse eid="JAS 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 5:2" />Buvubi bwanu bwakabola alimwi zisamo zyanu zyakaligwa amunanze. <verse eid="JAS 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 5:3" />Ingolide ansiliva zyanu zyaba angula, alimwi ngula yazyo njiiyooba kamboni atala andinywe alimwi iyoolya mibili yanu mbuli mulilo. Mwakalibambila buvubi bwanu kumazuba akumamanino aaya. <verse eid="JAS 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 5:4" />Amulange! Impindu yabasikubeleka aabo bakatebula myuunda yanu, eeyo njimutakwe mwakaliya, balalila, alimwi kulila kwabasikutebula kwasika kumatwi aMwami Singuzu. <verse eid="JAS 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 5:5" />Mwakapona chakukkalikana anyika amubuvubi, mwaneneesya myoyo yanu mwaba mbuli munyama ubambilidwe kufundwa. <verse eid="JAS 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 5:6" />Mwakapa mulandu akujeya muntu ululeme, taakwe naakamukakila pe.<verse eid="JAS 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Moyo Mulamfu Ankombyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 5:7" />Nkiikako, nibakwesu, mube amoyo mulamfu, , mane kukuboola kwaMwami. Ngamulange, mulimi ulalindila muchelo mubotu waanyika, kali amoyo mulamfu kuli nguwo mane ukajane imvula ntaanzi ayakumamanino. <verse eid="JAS 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 5:8" />Inywe alanu mube amoyo mulamfu. Ngamuyake myoyo yanu, nkaambo kuboola kwaMwami kuli afwiifwi.<verse eid="JAS 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 5:9" />Nibakwesu, mutanyontooki, kuli umwi awumwi, kuti mutakabetekwi; ngamulange, mubetesi uliimvwi kumulyango. <verse eid="JAS 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 5:10" />Nibakwesu, amuyeeye basinsimi aabo bakaambula muzina lyaMwami, mbuli chitondeenzyo chakupenzegwa amoyo mulamfu, <verse eid="JAS 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 5:11" />Ngamulange, tubaamba kuti balasekelela aabo bakakakatila. Mwakalumvwa lukakatilo lwaJobbu, alimwi mwakaabona mabambe aMwami, Mwami mbwakali aluzyalo aluse.<verse eid="JAS 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 5:12" />Nibakwesu, atala azyoonse, mutakonki pe, nikuba atala ajulu nikuba atala anyika nikuba kufumbwa chikonke chilibuti, pesi ngamubone kuti “iiyi” wanu abe iiyi mpawo “peepe” wanu abe peepe, kuchitila kuti mutakabi amulandu.<verse eid="JAS 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 5:13" />Kuli umwi na akati kanu ulimumapenzi? Mumuleke akombe. Kuli umwi na ubotelwa? Ngalumbayizye akwiimba. <verse eid="JAS 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 5:14" />Mpali na akati kanu uchiswa? Ngayite baalu bambungano, mpawo bamukombele, bamunanike mafuta muzina lyaMwami, <verse eid="JAS 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 5:15" />alimwi inkombyo yalusyomo ilamuponiya muntu uchiswa, mpawo Mwami ulamubusya, alimwi kuti wakali wachita zibi, uyoolekelelwa. <verse eid="JAS 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 5:16" />Nkikaako mulyaambilile zibi zyanu kuli umwi awumwi, mpawo mukombelane, kuti mukapone. Inkombyo yamuntu ululeme ili anguzu mpati mukubeleka kwayo. <verse eid="JAS 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 5:17" />Elayija wakali muntu mukulengwa mbuli ndiswe alimwi wakakomba kapati kuti imvula itawi, alimwi kwaminyaka itatu amyeezi ilimusanu awumwi imvula taakwe niyakawa pe anyika. <verse eid="JAS 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 5:18" />Eelyo wakakomba lubo mpawo julu lyakawisya mvula, alimwi inyika yakazyala muchelo.<verse eid="JAS 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 5:19" />Nibakwesu, kuti umwi akati kanu waleya kuzwa kukasimpe mpawo umwi wanu wamuboozya, <verse eid="JAS 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 5:20" />ngamuzibe kuti, kufumbwa uboozya sizibi kuzwa kukulubizya kwakwe uyoofutula muuya wakwe kuzwa kulufu alimwi uyovumba zibi zyiingi.<verse eid="JAS 5:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 5" />
</usx>